    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a ground-breaking accomplishment, CIME has set a new standard at the beginning of the year by introducing Sim Consults, a pioneering initiative aimed at raising awareness about healthcare simulation and fostering its utilization across regions and beyond. Sim Consults represent a significant step towards democratizing access to simulation resources and expertise, making them more accessible to healthcare professionals worldwide.",
